{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13220410","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13220410","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1322041001:1":{"text":"<male>お兄ちゃん</male><female>お姉ちゃん</female>、イゴールお兄ちゃん、アレックス、みんなありがとう！","source_cn":"谢谢你们——<male>大哥哥</male><fema...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x027B2E267B206E1B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<male>お兄ちゃん</male><female>お姉ちゃん</female>、イゴールお兄ちゃん、アレックス、みんなありがとう！","female":"<male>お兄ちゃん</male><female>お姉ちゃん</female>、イゴールお兄ちゃん、アレックス、みんなありがとう！","variant_male_record_index":"152966","variant_female_record_index":"152967","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322041002:1":{"text":"もう少し一緒に遊びたかったけど、そろそろ帰らないとママに気づかれちゃうから……","source_cn":"我好想多和你们玩一会，可是再不回家的话，一定会被妈妈发...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD23C5F2B89C840E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322041003:1":{"text":"気にしないで！見つかる前に早くうちに帰りなよ。また今度一緒に遊ぼう！","source_cn":"没关系，你回去吧，别被家里人发现！我们下次再一起玩！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5814018CA94B513B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322041004:1":{"text":"俺も！俺も呼べよ！すっげー楽しかったぜ！","source_cn":"有趣，太有趣了！我也要一起！叫我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D5FA1018AE3BB7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322041005:1":{"text":"いいよ！次は川辺に集まって、スケートをしよう！","source_cn":"好呀，下次我们在河边集合，去滑冰！","s